{"pin":"BES","name":"Ben","class":"903","updated_at":"2026-09-11T14:37:38.187Z","p1":{"title":"The Wave","desc":"I have many great experiences at the Wave, honestly it is one of the most well-known structures in Nova Scotia, and I've Had so many fun memories  of going there as a kid","img":"https://i.cbc.ca/ais/1.3098597,1743099436000/full/max/0/default.jpg?im=Crop%2Crect%3D%280%2C0%2C1919%2C1079%29%3B","coords":[44.6471676165784,-63.570037751609135]},"p2":{"title":"","desc":"Zatsman Sportsplex is The place I spent the most time at other than home, I go there when I feel down, when I don't, and when I want to improve myself, I honestly think I have improved so much using the Sportsplex.","img":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQ5Kf0iMNDOGLoAu2tBZ2_DTb1A-0wMRcAf5jmz9iZHSXfF96W3c-TVqf8&s=10","coords":[44.66935007389601,-63.57483292685494]},"p3":{"title":"Newfoundland","desc":"Newfoundland is the place where my father was born, we have visited it before and it brings many happy memories back from visiting.","img":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQiuWsxAO7BiDYRdM8Rx-OpuI7fKvPUvwzj6DgYP_bkjg&s=10","coords":[54.066653507108086,298.19480183239745]},"p4":{"title":"Paris","desc":"Paris is the land of tourists, not much more need to be said, it has good food, amazing views, and good monuments.","img":"https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/04/c5/48/a2/comedie-tour-eiffel.jpg?w=500&h=-1&s=1","coords":[48.82540165609253,2.3314439957516475]},"p5":{"title":"All Star- Smash mouth","desc":"I listened to it everywhere when I was younger, honestly has stuck in my head for a long time","yt":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=L_jWHffIx5E Smash Mouth- All Star"},"className":"903","issues":{"trade_war":"3","port_halifax":"1","ai_employment":"3","social_media_bans":"2","housing_youth":"3","education_vs_jobs":"1","ycja_reform":"1","climate_energy":"3","indigenous_treaties":"3","healthcare_politics":"1"},"news_sources":["📱 TikTok / R